    // falls through to its extension lookup. Return TYPES follow dart:core: floor,
    // ceil, round and truncate answer an int even on a double, and abs keeps the type.
    // Corpus citations, from tests/reference/dart/dart-language-tests:
    //   language/operator/arithmetic_test.dart:96-116  floor/ceil/round/truncate on an
    //                                   int answer the int itself, both signs, past 2^40
